## Downloadable GGUF models

`PaperCompLocal/ModelCatalog.json` lists optional models (for example Gemma and
Qwen GGUF builds) fetched at runtime from their upstream hosts (such as Hugging
Face). Those weights are not part of this source tree. Each model’s license and
terms apply to the downloaded files; review them before use.
